      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "POPS JOY (2) disappointed against the boys last week but she was going very well with a string of wins or placings prior. All of those were from wider barriers than this and she is suited back against her own sex so can bounce back. JANIE BLU (5) has been solid behind some handy rivals at her last couple and recorded a series of placings here prior. Can measure up back against the mares. DAVOLAS LEGACY NZ (9) was less than 2m behind POPS JOY when placed two back then beat that rival by 1.3m when she scored at this circuit and distance last time. Draws wider but she is going well. RIKIBREAL (4) was rewarded for her recent consistency with a last-start Bathurst win and has placed over this distance the three times she has raced at this venue. The ace draw could see WHERE BACK (1) competitive.",
